eType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2811273235,"text":"それから、こちらはただの「ジン」だ。「団長」としてのジンではない。","nextNodeIds":[3770207]},{"nodeId":3770207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":4193527427,"text":"栄誉騎士の君でも、そうそう接触できない人物だろう。","nextNodeIds":[3770208]},{"nodeId":3770208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3980181299,"text":"意外だ。","nextNodeIds":[3770209]},{"nodeId":3770209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2513242555,"text":"天空のライアーの話は聞いていたが、まさか君だったとは…","nextNodeIds":[3770210]},{"nodeId":3770210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1984650835,"text":"では、ディルックが言ったようにライアーの音で風魔龍が浄化され元に戻るという話は…本当なのか？","nextNodeIds":[3770211]},{"nodeId":3770211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":346844323,"text":"#そうだよ！今、この栄誉騎士{NICKNAME}は風魔龍事件を解決するために、最前線で頑張ってる。","nextNodeIds":[3770212]},{"nodeId":3770212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":707678459,"text":"さすが騎士団のスーパールーキーだよ。","nextNodeIds":[3770213]},{"nodeId":3770213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2371980915,"text":"違法なこともやらかしそうになったけどな…","nextNodeIds":[3770214]},{"nodeId":3770214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":4183490499,"text":"ふん、神話と関わるような荒唐無稽な説明を信じないのも無理はない。","nextNodeIds":[3770215]},{"nodeId":3770215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":1770496155,"text":"だが、問題ない。詩人にもう一度歌ってもらって、この…","nextNodeIds":[3770216]},{"nodeId":3770216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":175333099,"text":"信じるさ。","nextNodeIds":[3770217]},{"nodeId":3770217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":1848302099,"text":"頑固な団長様を説得…ん？","nextNodeIds":[3770218]},{"nodeId":3770218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3422642243,"text":"四風守護の東風の龍、トワリン、彼の裏切る理由がどう考えても分からなかった。","nextNodeIds":[3770219]},{"nodeId":3770219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1953927379,"text":"数百年前のモンドを守る戦争で、毒血の侵食を受け…","nextNodeIds":[3770220]},{"nodeId":3770220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1220537083,"text":"目覚めた後もアビスの魔術師のせいで腐食を受けたのなら、そうなるのも筋が通る…","nextNodeIds":[3770221]},{"nodeId":3770221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1048153043,"text":"——でもこれは「代理団長」の立場としては、絶対に口にできないことだ。","nextNodeIds":[3770222]},{"nodeId":3770222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2424007867,"text":"「ファデュイ」の圧力のせいで、騎士団が公に風魔龍への善意を示すことは難しい。","nextNodeIds":[3770223]},{"nodeId":3770223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":729467243,"text":"そんなことをすれば、務めを放棄したと解釈される可能性もある。だから私は、プライベートという形で行動するしかない。","nextNodeIds":[3770224]},{"nodeId":3770224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":993660739,"text":"ふん。","nextNodeIds":[3770225]},{"nodeId":3770225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2338407619,"text":"そういうところも、騎士団の嫌いな理由の一つだ。","nextNodeIds":[3770226]},{"nodeId":3770226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":3050734179,"text":"ただ、この正体の分からない異邦人をそのまま信じるとは思わなかった…","nextNodeIds":[3770227]},{"nodeId":3770227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":4215012083,"text":"<color=#00E1FFFF>先輩</color>のような厳しくて慎重な人でも、この旅人を信用しているではないか？","nextNodeIds":[3770228]},{"nodeId":3770228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2518075939,"text":"だから先輩はやめろ…今回は協力すると決めている。","nextNodeIds":[3770229,3770230]},{"nodeId":3770229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2763780259,"text":"先輩？","nextNodeIds":[3770231]},{"nodeId":3770231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1389728051,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[3770232]},{"nodeId":3770232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1009,"speakerName":"ディルック","textMapHash":2231091139,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[3770233]},{"nodeId":3770233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2951195675,"text":"触れちゃいけない過去があるみたいだな…","nextNodeIds":[3770234]},{"nodeId":3770234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":2819103403,"text":"とにかく、天空のライアーについては心当たりがある。","nextNodeIds":[3770235]},{"nodeId":3770235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":2894356947,"text":"（何事もないように話題を変えた！彼女、やるねぇ…）","nextNodeIds":[3770236]},{"nodeId":3770236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3592039835,"text":"モンドとスネージナヤの衝突、本質的には七国と七神の衝突だが。","nextNodeIds":[3770237]},{"nodeId":3770237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":3458640827,"text":"氷の神が率いる「ファデュイ」は、風神が残した力を利用しようと企んでいる…","nextNodeIds":[3770238]},{"nodeId":3770238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1001,"speakerName":"ウェンティ","textMapHash":137498235,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[3770239,3770240]},{"nodeId":3770239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2108651307,"text":"彼らはモンドの防御を管理するつもり？","nextNodeIds":[3770241]},{"nodeId":3770241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":1718908227,"text":"そうだ。","nextNodeIds":[3770242]},{"nodeId":3770242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":4201366835,"text":"もし、風龍を殺す計画を騎士団が止めたとなると…","nextNodeIds":[3770243]},{"nodeId":3770243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1006,"speakerName":"ジン","textMapHash":783005299,"text":"天空のライアーは、彼らが唯一手にすることができる風神の力だ。","nextNodeIds":[3770244]},